original first assembly once, retains all actual attempts and the last private
owner, and distinguishes postcheck metadata, Fatal, SevereBreak, and typed stops.
No future09 applied-source hash is assumed. Reuse these real owners, original
construction/material names, selected flags, and declared order. Preprocess once.

Future10 orchestration must publish an ordered construction public-owner vector,
including exact reset/early-return, generated, reverse-reused, unrepresentable,
and unreached custody. Reverse chooser should reuse original-ID predicates from
the03 owner but borrow actual earlier public storage. Actual Init aggregate state
is a separate owner. Fatal stops later whole calls; shared severe/loading flags
